' =====================================================================
' 又见炊烟餐饮管理系统 - 预订端到端时序图
' 流程：客户预订 → 桌台预留 → 点菜 → 后厨接单 → 出菜 → 结账 → 桌台释放
' 工具：PlantUML (https://plantuml.com/zh/sequence-diagram)
' =====================================================================

@startuml seq_booking_e2e

!theme plain
skinparam roundCorner 6
skinparam ArrowColor #1a3a2a
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor #F5F0E8
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor #1a3a2a
skinparam ParticipantFontColor #1a3a2a
skinparam ActorBackgroundColor #C4A35A
skinparam ActorBorderColor #1a3a2a
skinparam DatabaseBackgroundColor #1a3a2a
skinparam DatabaseFontColor #FFD78A
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFF7E0
skinparam NoteBorderColor #C4A35A

title 又见炊烟餐饮管理系统 - 预订端到端时序图

actor "客户" as Customer
participant "前端\nBookings.vue" as FE
participant "BookingController" as BC
participant "NotifyPublisher" as NP
queue "RabbitMQ\nyoujian.notify" as MQ
participant "NotifyConsumer" as NC
participant "TableController" as TC
participant "IpadOrderController" as OC
participant "KitchenController" as KC
database "MySQL\nbanquet" as DB

' ---------------------------------------------------------------------
' 1. 创建预订
' ---------------------------------------------------------------------
== 1. 创建预订 ==
Customer -> FE : 填写预订信息\n(日期/桌数/人数/套餐)
FE -> BC : POST /api/bookings\n{storeId, bookingDate, ...}
BC -> DB : INSERT booking_master\n(status='confirmed')
BC -> DB : INSERT booking_table\n(关联桌台)
BC -> DB : UPDATE table_master\nSET table_status='reserved'
BC -> NP : publish(booking.created)
NP -> DB : INSERT sys_notification
NP -> MQ : convertAndSend(notify.event)
MQ -> NC : @RabbitListener
NC -> NC : [待接入] 前台看板 WebSocket 推送
BC -> FE : 200 OK {bookingId}
FE -> Customer : 预订成功提示

' ---------------------------------------------------------------------
' 2. 客户到店开台
' ---------------------------------------------------------------------
== 2. 客户到店开台 ==
Customer -> FE : 扫码/输入预订号
FE -> BC : GET /api/bookings/{bookingId}
BC -> DB : SELECT booking_master
BC -> FE : 200 OK {booking, tableList}
FE -> TC : PUT /api/tables/{id}/status\n{status='occupied'}
TC -> DB : UPDATE table_master\nSET table_status='occupied'
TC -> FE : 200 OK
FE -> Customer : 开台完成\n进入点菜界面

' ---------------------------------------------------------------------
' 3. iPad 点菜下单
' ---------------------------------------------------------------------
== 3. iPad 点菜下单 ==
Customer -> FE : 选择菜品\n拖拽至购物车
FE -> OC : POST /api/ipad/orders\n{bookingId, dishList}
OC -> DB : INSERT booking_dish_detail\n(kitchen_status='pending')
OC -> DB : UPDATE booking_master\nSET total_amount=Σ(subtotal)
OC -> NP : publish(order.created)
NP -> MQ : convertAndSend
MQ -> NC : @RabbitListener
NC -> NC : [待接入] KDS 厨房屏 WebSocket 推送
OC -> FE : 200 OK {orderId}

' ---------------------------------------------------------------------
' 4. 后厨接单与出品
' ---------------------------------------------------------------------
== 4. 后厨接单与出品 ==
KC -> DB : SELECT booking_dish_detail\nWHERE kitchen_status='pending'
KC -> DB : UPDATE booking_dish_detail\nSET kitchen_status='cooking'
KC -> NP : publish(dish.served)\n（按菜品批次）
NP -> MQ : convertAndSend
MQ -> NC : @RabbitListener
NC -> NC : [待接入] 前台看板 WebSocket 推送\n通知服务员上菜

' ---------------------------------------------------------------------
' 5. 结账支付
' ---------------------------------------------------------------------
== 5. 结账支付 ==
Customer -> FE : 确认账单\n支付方式选择
FE -> BC : PUT /api/bookings/{id}\n{payment_status='paid', final_amount}
BC -> DB : UPDATE booking_master\nSET payment_status='paid',\n    booking_status='completed'
BC -> DB : INSERT orders\n(order_type='banquet', pay_amount)
BC -> NP : publish(booking.confirmed)
NP -> MQ : convertAndSend
MQ -> NC : @RabbitListener
NC -> NC : [待接入] 短信通道\n（客户回访短信）
BC -> FE : 200 OK {finalAmount}
FE -> Customer : 支付成功\n小票打印

' ---------------------------------------------------------------------
' 6. 桌台释放（超时自动/手动）
' ---------------------------------------------------------------------
== 6. 桌台释放 ==
FE -> TC : PUT /api/tables/{id}/status\n{status='idle'}
TC -> DB : UPDATE table_master\nSET table_status='idle'
alt 桌位无任何活跃预订
  TC -> DB : 检查 booking_table 关联
  TC -> TC : count==0 → 释放
end
TC -> FE : 200 OK

' ---------------------------------------------------------------------
' 异常分支：客户取消预订
' ---------------------------------------------------------------------
== 异常：客户取消预订（违约金计算）==
Customer -> FE : 取消预订
FE -> BC : DELETE /api/bookings/{id}
BC -> BC : 计算违约金\n(按 config.cancellation_penalty)
BC -> DB : UPDATE booking_master\nSET booking_status='cancelled'
BC -> DB : UPDATE table_master\nSET table_status='idle'
BC -> NP : publish(booking.cancelled)
NP -> MQ : convertAndSend
MQ -> NC : @RabbitListener
NC -> NC : [待接入] 短信通知客户\n（释放桌位）
BC -> FE : 200 OK {refundAmount, penalty}

note over Customer, DB
  <b>关键业务规则</b>（来自 config 表）
  - 退款比例：开餐前 ≥24h 退 100% / 24~6h 退 50% / <6h 不退
  - 违约金：默认 20%，按取消时间阶梯
  - 桌位保留：30 分钟超时自动释放
  - 桌台占用上限：4 小时
end note

@enduml
